# 📖 TOEFL Reading - Day 08

## Passage

Many animals adapt to changing environments in order to survive. Some change their behavior, while others develop physical characteristics that help them find food and avoid danger.

---

## Question

Why do animals adapt to changing environments?

A. To become larger

B. To survive

C. To sleep more

D. To communicate with humans

---

## Answer

B. To survive

---

## Key Vocabulary

- adapt = 적응하다
- survive = 생존하다
- behavior = 행동
- characteristic = 특징
- avoid = 피하다
